WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Heavily holding the freedom

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Choosing the invisible path

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
We wander into the light

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.330
The third Akki Rasetsu!

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:44.270
The user of the Karasuma-Style
Fighting Armor!

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.000
Kurota Karasuma!

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.180
The fourth Akki Rasetsu!

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.510
The user of the Kaen-Style
Chinese Broadsword!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.310
Kaen Ryu!

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.820
The fifth Akki Rasetsu!

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.190
The user of the Hachisuka
Double-Blade Style!

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:03.550
Gensai Hachisuka!

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:11.930
Well, well, this is surely encouraging.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.320
Well...

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:21.360
I'm well aware of your capabilities.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:28.740
However, the other two
have been defeated already.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:37.250
Don't worry. This is just a precaution...

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.930
Tomorrow is the last day. It's finally time, Master.

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:51.070
Right. For tomorrow's performance,

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:53.910
I'll include the real name of the object
of your revenge in the dialogue.

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:55.440
I've been waiting for that!

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:59.380
I'm sure that they're already aware of that, too.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.270
It's guaranteed that they're going to use
an unexpected method to attack us.

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:06.380
We have no intention of
backing down, either. Never.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.180
That goes without saying.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.710
This time we'll kill the assassin ourselves!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.110
We won't let them die an easy death, either!

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.830
Of course not.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.400
We need to find out how they're
connected to that man, too.

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.730
We've got a guest!

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.700
From the Stone Crane Mansion!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.510
Meifu Hata

00:04:50.430 --> 00:05:00.200
2000 years ago, there was a man who was
beheaded for opposing Emperor Shi Huangdi.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:03.170
However, his grudge lingered on,
hating humanity and despising the world.

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:09.980
He returned from the Land of the Dead
as an evil spirit, dwelling in his severed head,

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:14.810
to bring war and disaster
upon the world again and again.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:22.550
The people were terrified and soon began
to call it The Head of the Conqueror.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:31.070
We owe the Hermit Jofuku for everything.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:42.480
Jofuku. Ordered by the Qin Emperor Shi
Huangdi to search for the elixir of eternal life.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.150
He took three thousand young men
and women to the island of Japan

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.680
located in a far-off place called Peng Lai.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:54.730
However, the true objective of his mission was
to seal and eliminate the Head of the Conqueror.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:06:04.230
But the Head returned to Japan from the
darkness with its incredible magical power.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:14.470
Head of the Conqueror, curse those
who wish to rule the world and seek power!

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:20.020
Bring chaos to the land, make the people suffer
and let there be many disasters everywhere!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:26.890
So shall history be written!
Let the wheel of history turn!

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:33.300
Demon Tamamonomae,
Prince Taira no Masakado,

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:38.530
the Demon Lord Nobunaga Oda, and now...

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:08.460
Kill, kill, kill...

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:11.400
Kill, kill...

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.770
Kill, kill...

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.270
Kill, kill, kill, kill...

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.180
Shureiki!

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.750
What an impressive dark mage!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.280
I'd expect nothing less from you,
Hermit Hata Meifu,

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:30.240
descendant of the eighth chief vassal
who served with Jofuku.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:36.190
The arts of black magic are nothing
compared to my secret arts!

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:40.930
Watch as I control the power
of the Head of the Conqueror!

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:45.930
Stop by and play with us!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:57.000
Here's Tayu Kotoha.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:01.250
Welcome.

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:06.490
What brought you here?

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:12.430
Are you sure you didn't find somebody else
behind my back, Sensei?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.830
Come on! The only one that
I care about is you, Tayu.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.760
A liar will surely go to Hell.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:25.170
I don't care if I'm with you though.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:29.410
You're quite the liar!

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:33.350
I'm just here to watch a play.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:38.350
I just have to see the play
tomorrow at the Ushioza.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:45.720
There are two sides to everything.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:55.840
Supposedly many officials in Edo
are very nervous right now.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:02.640
Well, that's the reason
this play has been so popular.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:07.440
I've heard that your patronage
is quite something as well, Tayu.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:13.890
Indeed. We're having a party
with those performers tonight.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.360
You should watch it, too, Sensei.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.060
Oh? That sounds entertaining.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:23.160
I guess we'd better finish talking about
boring stuff before the show, huh?

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.170
Well, then, Sensei.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.940
I'll need to go greet some people.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.710
Sure. Go ahead.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:40.470
Sorry about the wait.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:48.890
Hey, Tayu.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.430
Thank you for coming.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.160
So, does it look like they're going to move?

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:57.360
For now, they're continuing to be
mired down due to that big earthquake,

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:02.410
but supposedly some in the army are saying
that they should detour around it to attack Edo.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:08.940
We should probably take the initiative
and try to negotiate with Saigo ourselves.

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.780
Or...

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:15.710
...get help from England and push them back.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.450
I see!

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:23.650
But we might end up stirring up a nest of snakes.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.890
This is troublesome.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:44.820
Wait!

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:48.150
Are you just going to walk away after bumping
into the soul of a samurai?!

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.480
Oh...

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:50.520
Why you!

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.520
Don't do it!

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.960
Calm down!

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:01.670
Don't stop me!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.230
This is Japan!

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:06.200
I won't let you foreigners walk all over us!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.840
I'll kill you!

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:08.970
It is true...

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:10.640
This is Japan.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.240
But before that, this is still a private quarter!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:19.440
Before you start swinging that sword
around here, I'll ask you to follow our rules!

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.080
What did you say?

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:28.890
Young Master, this person
has outlasted his stay, hasn't he?

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:32.260
How much does he owe us so far?

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:34.120
Yeah!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:35.330
Shit.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:38.960
He owes us... Let me see...

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:43.230
It's not safe around here anymore.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:47.510
I can't believe people come to this place
carrying a sword for killing others.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.870
How tasteless... That's disgusting.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.170
Thanks, Tayu.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:56.210
You're welcome.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.720
Come, Katsu-sensei is expecting you.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.390
Young Master, show him there.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.190
Yes!

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:11.000
Kaku-sama!

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:12.560
Yo, Kakunojo!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.800
The best in Japan!

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.110
What?

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.860
Is that true?

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:35.190
Hold on. You can't make a scene here.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:37.220
But!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:41.260
To think the man who writes
for the traveling troupe is...

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:46.590
Now I really can't take my eyes off that play.

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:51.600
Tayu, thank you for inviting us today.

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:56.580
Actually I'm not quite aware of
what's going on myself.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:57.550
What?

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:01.490
It looks like we've received an excessive
amount of money for the flowers, too.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:05.080
I thought it was paid by your
preferred customer, but...

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:08.760
Is everything okay?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.160
Oh, yes...

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:13.260
I guess we'd better go with it
and see what happens.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:14.460
Yeah.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:28.410
I'm sure it's agonizing, for even a
traveling performer, to die on stage.

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:20.460
They've got rather interesting performers.

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:34.470
It's cold!

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:40.280
Hey, that foreigner from earlier is Parkes!

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:44.350
Parkes? You mean the English minister?

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:46.790
Let's kill him!

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.930
Don't be ridiculous!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:52.030
We've got a bigger mission to carry out.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.200
But!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:57.200
Killing foreigners is a mission, too!
Not to mention he's a famous one!

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.660
True! An opportunity like this
doesn't come too often!

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:01.530
Let's do it.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.880
All right.

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:36.300
Kill, kill, kill!

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.100
Why you!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.410
Kill, kill, kill!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:52.880
Kakashi!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.520
Shureiki, huh?

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:03.260
H-hey!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.230
What the...

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:06.930
What's going on out there?

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:13.100
Kill, kill, kill!

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.830
Not your business!

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:44.810
Yes!

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:51.950
K-Katsu?!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:23.850
Kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.750
Kill, kill!

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.960
S-someone, get the police!

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.050
Hold it!

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.900
This is a private quarter!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:43.460
There's no way I'll let police come in here!

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:46.060
We protect this place ourselves!

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:17.600
They must be in the hands of an immortal.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.150
It is pleased!

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:37.480
I can hear the laughter of the
Head of the Conqueror!

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:48.100
Those who desire it are gathering
in this land... Can it sense this?

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:54.360
Yes, indeed! Yes, indeed! Yes, indeed!

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:06.050
Hey, Mister Katsu!

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:13.790
These men...

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.760
They're no humans.

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:23.320
Make way!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.830
This is the Kanagawa Magistrate Office!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:31.630
I guess I have no choice but to
go and contain the situation myself.

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:33.580
Don't worry.

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.910
They're going to be here any minute now.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:41.210
It's rehearsal day!

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:55.820
Ready!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:58.970
Fire!

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.340
Kakashi!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:48.950
Are you okay?

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:56.160
Kakashi, you shouldn't move!

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:57.750
She's right. Stay still.

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:11.040
Good job!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.040
A nest of vipers, huh?

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.830
Troublous...

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>SHUREIKI UNLEASHED</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:48.470
EPISODE 6
THE CLOSING
PERFORMANCE
BURNS

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:38.890
Sotetsu Ibaraki, the true objective of this
play of revenge is the Head of the Conqueror!

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:42.190
That's the same objective
as yours, Akizuki-sama.

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:44.130
Sealing the Head...

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:46.530
That is my objective. Nothing else.

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:51.100
I, too, need it for the sake of Japan.

00:23:48.470 --> 00:24:02.570
THE CLOSING
<i>PERFORMANCE</i>
<i>BURNS</i>

00:23:51.340 --> 00:23:55.810
I won't let anyone take it.
I'll seal it with my own hands!

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:58.880
So that's your mission...

00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:01.910
...as the Eternal Assassin!
